## Probe note

CAP-G4 already preferred ProcessCap at sealed process ops. This residual moves **std call-site contracts** onto ProcessCap so callers can least-privilege without broad SysCap. Hard Sys residual (prctl/python_embed/join/epoll) stays SysCap-only — fail-closed if ProcessCap-only main tries them.
